<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  SuperFlow colour system.

  A calm, warm, paper-like light scheme built around a single grounded green.
  Calm is a feature: no alarm reds for a missed day, no saturated gamification.
  Misses use a warm amber, never a punitive red.
-->
